# scenario-sweep batch 1 of ~7 — the 40-scenario inventory (Fable, 2026-07-30)
#
# WHY: we ran ~5 of 40 harness scenarios today and 2 of those 5 were silently
# broken (farm, autonomy-death-spiral — confirmed pre-existing, NOT caused by
# #57). We do not currently know which of our own tests pass. This sweep
# establishes that baseline, and gives the aging fix (#59) a regression floor.
#
# ★ THE FIRST TWO LINES ARE POSITIVE CONTROLS. Both are KNOWN-BROKEN as of
# 0feceef806. If this sweep reports either of them GREEN, the sweep itself is
# lying and every other result in it is void. Check them first.
#
# Batch sized to 6 VMs: IN_USE_ADDRESSES quota is 8 PER REGION, so 8 jobs would
# schedule to the exact cap and bounce. Remaining scenarios follow in later
# batches.
#
# Run: VM_ZONE=us-east1-b BRANCH=bastion/apex-engine-integration \
#      bash vm-jobs.sh scenario-sweep-batch1.jobs e2-standard-8 25 90

